  "name": "Arturia KeyLab Essential 61 mk3 (DAW)",
  "protocol": "generic",
  "source": "Read off the real device (2026-11-19, DAW program, MIDI Control Center defaults): its \"MIDI\" port sends the encoders as absolute CC 96-104 and the faders as CC 105-113 on channel 1, Play CC 21, Stop CC 20, Record CC 22, Loop CC 24, Rewind CC 25, Forward CC 26, track left / right CC 44 / 45 (buttons 127 / 0), the main encoder CC 116 relative around 64 (push CC 117: in the Session it launches / stops the selected clip, the wheel and the track buttons walk the slots); Undo CC 42, Redo CC 43, Metro CC 27, Save CC 40, Quantize CC 41, Tap CC 23; the \"MCU/HUI\" port stays silent in this setup (see arturia.keylab-essential-61-mk3 for the MCU transport mode). Only the \"MIDI\" port answers the identity request (00 20 6B / 02 00 / 05 74), so the profile matches by identity; keys and pads on that port stay plain MIDI.",
